    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const excludedLabelIds = [\n  \"Label_5\",   // Newsletter\n  \"Label_21\",  // Inquiry\n  \"Label_11\",  // Invoice\n  \"Label_9\",   // Proposal\n  \"Label_52\",  // Action Required\n  \"Label_55\",  // Follow-up Reminder\n  \"Label_53\",  // Task\n  \"Label_44\",  // Personal\n  \"Label_54\",  // Urgent\n  \"Label_12\",  // Bank\n  \"Label_3\",   // Job Update\n  \"Label_42\",  // Spam / Junk\n  \"Label_7\",   // Social / Networking\n  \"Label_8\",   // Receipt\n  \"Label_2\",   // Event Invite\n  \"Label_10\",  // Subscription Renewal\n  \"Label_4\"    // System Notification\n];\n\n\nreturn items.filter(item => {\n  const labels = item.json.labelIds || [];\n  // Exclude if ANY excluded label is present\n  return !labels.some(label => excludedLabelIds.includes(label));\n});\n"
      },
      "id": "b5ed8bda-65fe-47e6-83f2-c1a6fe086564",
      "name": "Filter Emails Without Excluded Labels",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "position": [
        544,
        384
      ],
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Here is the email details:\nFrom: { $('Merge').item.json.headers.from }}\nSubject line: {{ $json.headers.subject }}\nEmail Body: \n{{ $json.text }}",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an expert executive assistant specialized in drafting professional email replies. Your sole task is to generate a polished draft response to the incoming email.\n\n## CONTEXT\nYou are replying on behalf of the \"uraisolution Team\".\n\n## DRAFT WRITING RULES\n1. Tone: Maintain a highly professional, welcoming, and executive tone. \n2. Content Focus: \n   - Express enthusiasm for the substantial partnership.\n   - Propose moving forward with scheduling the discovery call.\n3. Structure:\n   - Professional greeting (e.g., \"Dear [Sender Name] or Client Team,\")\n   - Clear, direct appreciation and confirmation of next steps.\n   - Provide placeholders like [Insert Date 1] or a call-to-action link for scheduling.\n   - Professional closing (e.g., \"Best regards,<br>uraisolution Team\")\n\n## FORMATTING RULES\n- You must preserve the email thread context by outputting the correct subject line.\n- The generated draft message MUST use standard HTML line breaks (`<br>`) or paragraph tags (`<p>`) for spacing so it looks like a real, readable email layout.\n- Do not include any markdown styling (like `**bold**` or `*italics*`) inside the draft message.\n- Fill in the required JSON keys exactly as requested by the parser."
        }
      },
      "id": "15d37950-cfc9-47e2-8982-7c4e5306737a",
      "name": "AI Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
